#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/youtube_4K_and_2K.rst:114
msgid ""
"Newer versions of Kdenlive already have 2K project profiles (:abbr:`QHD "
"(Quad-HD)`) and 4K project profiles for :abbr:`UHD (Ultra High Definition)` "
"and :abbr:`DCI (Digital Cinema Initiative)` with a variety of frame rates. "
"Therefore, the following steps are only needed if your Kdenlive version does "
"not have them (seriously consider an upgrade) or if you want to change "
"certain parameters."
msgstr ""
"Novšie verzie Kdenlive už majú 2K projektové profily (:abbr:`QHD (Quad-HD)`) "
"a 4K projektové profily pre :abbr:`UHD (Ultra High Definition)` a :abbr:`DCI "
"(Digital Cinema Initiative)` s rôznymi snímkovými frekvenciami. Nasledujúce "
"kroky sú preto potrebné iba vtedy, ak vaša verzia Kdenlive tieto profily "
"nemá (vážne zvážte aktualizáciu) alebo ak chcete zmeniť určité parametre."

